<h2>4. Home Dashboard & Dynamic Contextual Greetings</h2>

<div class="two-column">
  <div class="column-text">
    <p>
      The <strong>Home Dashboard</strong> serves as the central command center of ChemBuddy. It gives you an immediate overview of your academic health, daily schedule, and cognitive enrichment upon opening the app.
    </p>

    <h3>4.1 Claude-Inspired Contextual Greetings</h3>
    <p>
      The header dynamically adapts based on time of day, day of the week, and your real-time attendance percentage:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Late Night (11 PM - 4 AM):</strong> <em>"Burning the midnight Bunsen burner, Prajwal? Don't forget sleep consolidates memory."</em></li>
      <li><strong>Morning (5 AM - 12 PM):</strong> <em>"Good morning, Prajwal 🔬 Catalysis is chemistry with a shortcut."</em></li>
      <li><strong>Attendance Warning (&lt;75%):</strong> <em>"⚠️ Attendance critical (72.4%). You cannot afford to miss today's lectures!"</em></li>
      <li><strong>Excellence Praise (&gt;85%):</strong> <em>"✨ Outstanding attendance health (91.2%). Safe bunks available: 5 classes."</em></li>
    </ul>

    <h3>4.2 Attendance Health Ring</h3>
    <p>
      A circular progress ring visually communicates your university compliance status:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong style="color: #10B981;">Green (&ge;75%):</strong> Exam Eligible. Displays the exact number of classes you can safely skip.</li>
      <li><strong style="color: #EF4444;">Red (&lt;75%):</strong> Attendance Shortage. Displays the exact consecutive classes needed to recover eligibility.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>4.3 Daily Psychology Facts Engine</h3>
    <p>
      Inspired by the popular "Psychology Facts" app, ChemBuddy includes a curated database of <strong>120+ evidence-based cognitive insights</strong>. A new fact rotates daily at 8:00 PM IST using a prime-weighted calendar algorithm.
    </p>
  </div>

