<div class="page-break"></div>
<h2>7. ChemDraw Pro & Ketcher Pro (118-Element Molecular Sketcher)</h2>
<h2>8. Reaction Product Prediction & 2D Vector SVG Generator</h2>

<div class="two-column">
  <div class="column-text">
    <h3>7.1 Molecular Sketcher Capabilities</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Full 118-Element Periodic Table:</strong> Searchable modal with standard CPK color coding.</li>
      <li><strong>Bond Tools:</strong> Single, double, triple, wedge (stereochemical up), dash (stereochemical down), and curved electron arrows (<code>&curvearrowright;</code>).</li>
      <li><strong>Formal Charges:</strong> <code>+1</code>, <code>-1</code>, <code>+2</code>, <code>-2</code> with circled badges and <code>M CHG</code> Molfile export.</li>
      <li><strong>Marquee Selection (<code>⬚</code>) & 2D Clean-Up (<code>🧹</code>):</strong> Standardizes bond lengths to 55px and optimizes angles.</li>
      <li><strong>Multi-Reactant Mode:</strong> When two disconnected molecules are drawn on canvas, ChemBuddy renders a cyan <code>+</code> symbol between them and outputs dot-separated SMILES (e.g. <code>C1=CCC=C1.c1ccccc1</code>).</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>8.1 Reaction Predictor & 2D Vector SVG</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Gemini AI Internet Prediction:</strong> Queries Google Gemini AI to predict the major product, formal reaction name, mechanism class, and curved electron-pushing arrows.</li>
      <li><strong>Publication-Quality 2D Vector SVG:</strong> Replaced raw text boxes with crisp, scalable vector SVGs rendered directly in the prediction bottom sheet for Diels-Alder adducts, biaryls, and rings.</li>
      <li><strong>45+ Instant Offline Rules:</strong> Zero-latency local fallback ensures predictions always succeed even without internet.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="column-image">
    <div class="screenshot-container">
