<h2>13. PDF Library, Study Hub & Strictly Grounded RAG Assistant</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Offline PDF Viewer:</strong> High-performance document reader with page jumping, keyword search, and zoom.</li>
  <li><strong>Local Text Extraction:</strong> Extracts text locally on your device without uploading files to third-party servers.</li>
  <li><strong>Strictly Grounded RAG Chat:</strong> In <em>"From My PDF"</em> mode, ChemBuddy's AI responses are strictly grounded in your uploaded documents. If the answer is not in the text, it explicitly states so, preventing hallucinations.</li>
</ul>

<!-- CHAPTER 14, 15, 16 -->
<div class="page-break"></div>
<h2>14. Exam Mode & BCU Model Answer Generator</h2>
<p>
  Specifically calibrated to the examination patterns of Bengaluru City University (BCU), Central Universities, and state university MSc programs:
</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>2-Mark Mode:</strong> Generates crisp 2-to-3 sentence definitions, balanced equations, or IUPAC names for Section A questions.</li>
  <li><strong>5-Mark Mode:</strong> Formats answers into the standard 5-part university rubric: Principle, Balanced Reaction, Stepwise Mechanism with Intermediates, Synthetic Applications, and Summary.</li>
  <li><strong>10-Mark Mode:</strong> Comprehensive long-form essays complete with orbital transition state diagrams, stereochemical proofs, retrosynthetic analysis, and industrial examples.</li>
</ul>

<h2>15. Settings, Local Backup, Privacy & Offline Architecture</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Notification Toggles:</strong> Individual controls for Class Reminders, 8:30 AM Timetable Briefing, 8:00 PM Psychology Facts, and Exam Deadlines.</li>
  <li><strong>Instant Test Dispatch:</strong> Tap <em>"Send Test Notification"</em> or <em>"Send Psychology Fact"</em> to verify notifications immediately.</li>
  <li><strong>Local JSON Export & Restore:</strong> Export all profile records, attendance logs, timetable entries, and custom flashcards as an unencrypted portable JSON file. Restore seamlessly on any new device.</li>
  <li><strong>Zero Cloud Lock-in:</strong> ChemBuddy never requires an account or cloud sign-in. Your data belongs exclusively to you.</li>
</ul>

<h2>16. Troubleshooting & Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>

<div class="callout callout-warning">
  <div class="callout-title">Q1: Why didn't my 8:30 AM timetable notification sound?</div>
  <strong>Answer:</strong> On Android 12+, ensure that <em>"Alarms & Reminders"</em> permission is granted in Android System Settings. Additionally, set battery usage for ChemBuddy to <em>"Unrestricted"</em> so Android's Doze mode does not defer morning alarms.
</div>

<div class="callout callout-warning">
  <div class="callout-title">Q2: Should I keep my older app or install the new APK?</div>
  <strong>Answer:</strong> You must <strong>uninstall / delete the older app</strong> and install <code>ChemBuddy-v3.5.1-by-Prajwal-A-Kambar.apk</code>. The new APK contains the updated graph BFS/DFS SMILES generator, Gemini AI reaction prediction, and 2D vector SVG engine compiled into the native binary.
</div>

<div class="callout callout-warning">
  <div class="callout-title">Q3: How does ChemBuddy calculate attendance if a class is cancelled?</div>
  <strong>Answer:</strong> Mark the class as <em>Postponed / Cancelled (&par;)</em>. ChemBuddy excludes that class from both the numerator and denominator, ensuring your percentage is never unfairly penalized.
</div>

<div class="callout callout-warning">
  <div class="callout-title">Q4: Does Ask ChemBuddy work without internet?</div>
  <strong>Answer:</strong> The core features (attendance, 16 calculators, spectroscopy solver, pericyclic rules, flashcards, and 45+ offline reaction predictions) work 100% offline. Online Gemini AI mode connects over the internet to generate dynamic mechanisms for unlisted or custom molecules.
</div>

